# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps local-only
# artifacts from ever being copied into the build stage by `COPY . .` --
# none of these should be able to leak into a published image just because
# they happened to exist on whoever's machine (or CI runner) ran the build.
.git/
target/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
certs/
*.pem
*.key
config.toml
